    "terrainName": "cqb-village",
    "description": "What: AQ102 S6 (CE-2362) - on cqb-village, 'Gunman' (Hostile rifleman, immortal) holds a ground-floor window of the OBJ house (house-3f at (125,161)) facing south; 'Pinned' (Friend rifleman, immortal) is the last fighting man of 'Blue Squad' - 'Down 1-3' are incapacitated beside him - out in the open ~92 m south at (130,70), the squad ordered to bound to the house; 'Far Car' at (150,72) is the only cover, 20 m off. Judge (120 s): (1) Pinned drops prone under fire and returns fire; (2) pinned, he does not stay on one spot: a 2 m+ move at least every 15 s, alternating sides; (3) after ~30 s pinned and alone he crawls to the car; (4) the aim: the Gunman's shots at a prone man are aimed at a prone chest (not over him) and Pinned's shots at the window reach the opening (not the wall under it) - printed per shooter (aim height, ends, crossings, hits). Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch rf-pinned-in-open. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/blueprints/Architect_Question_102_Responsive_Fighting_Reflexes.md \u00a75"
